<div class="uesrpg-startup">
  <div class="dialogForm">
    <div class="startup-panel startup-panel--social">
      <a class="startup-social-link" href="{{discordInviteUrl}}" aria-label="Discord">
        <i class="fab fa-discord fa-2x"></i>
      </a>
      <a class="startup-social-link" href="{{githubUrl}}" aria-label="GitHub">
        <i class="fab fa-github fa-2x"></i>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="startup-panel startup-panel--copy">
      <h2>Join the Community!</h2>
      <p class="startup-copy">
        Hey adventurer! Thanks for checking out the UESRPG system on Foundry.
        You can learn more about the game, download the free rulebooks, and
        connect with the community on the
        <a href="{{discordInviteUrl}}">Discord Server</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Special Thanks</h2>
      <ul class="startup-thanks-list">
        <li>DogBoneZone, the original author of the `uesrpg-d100` Foundry VTT system from which this fork began.</li>
        <li>Gman95, the original creator of the UESRPG-Revised module, from which much of this system's content was adapted.</li>
        <li>jamejtb and supagreybard for maintaining and updating the main fork.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="startup-panel startup-panel--note">
      <p>You can disable this popup in System Settings by checking the option not to show it again.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
